                                                "sense_id": "e67955c3-739e-3ab1-b1d7-961367e713e8",
                                                "text": "If f(x)#61;x², the differential of f is the function #92;operatorname#123;d#125;#92;#33;f(x,#92;Deltax)#61;f'(x)#92;Deltax#61;2x#92;Deltax."
                                            }
